      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you use ScopedXXX util instead of getting/release array/utfchar by yourself ? JNI is hard that you may easily to forget the release or release in invalid status.\nLooking at the JNI tip, it says \"You must Release every array you Get. Also, if the Get call fails, you must ensure that your code doesn\u0027t try to Release a NULL pointer later.\" So the current code would crash if the JNI getXXX fail.\n\nhttps://developer.android.com/training/articles/perf-jni",
